      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسحّج</span></b>  <i>It had its outer integument,</i> or
<i>superficial part, abraded,</i> or <i>otherwise removed,
much,</i> or <i>often:</i> (S, K:) said of the skin
